<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Tuskar names Stephen Carroll head of finance.</title>
<headline>Tuskar names Stephen Carroll head of finance.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish-based exploration firm Tuskar Resources Plc said on Tuesday it had appointed Stephen Carroll as head of finance.</p>
<p>Carroll would also continue in his role as company secretary, Tuskar said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom +44 353 1 661 3377</p>
